EBS Sp. z o.o. is a dynamically growing Polish technology company with over 35 years of experience, specializing in the development of smart security solutions. We are part of the American corporation Alarm.com (Nasdaq: ALRM), a leading global provider of intelligent security solutions.
&gt;
Alarm.com values working together and collaborating in person. We are building a new team in Krakow. Our employees work fully from the office with the possibility to work remotely occasionally.
&gt;
